        "title": "fix(agents): use truncateUtf16Safe for runner error text truncation",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nOne `.slice(0, 200)` truncation site in the embedded agent runner may cut UTF-16 surrogate pairs in half when the error text contains multi-byte characters such as emoji.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run.ts`: replace `errorText.slice(0, 200)` with `truncateUtf16Safe(errorText, 200)`.\n\nLabel: bugfix | merge-risk: 🟢 minimal",
